{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_10_level_main_10-10_beg",
  "groupId": "main_10",
  "stageId": "main_10-10",
  "title": "千瘡百孔",
  "storyCode": "10-11",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-10_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "eb6a82c5107791ca7bd936643128f0658a5c8efcaaf86fabc7f1c1a397616bad",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "09-beg"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "這麼說，赫德雷失敗了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "是的，將軍。我親眼看見了，在剛剛那場戰鬥中，他受了重傷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "你剛才還說了，與他交手的，除了他那名雇傭兵老相識，還有一位薩卡茲女性？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "沒錯。但她......很善於躲藏，而且她的速度太快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "我不敢走太近，我總覺得，她差一點就要發現我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "明智的選擇。否則的話，你不可能活著回到這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "不過，赦罪師竟然放過了巴別塔的刺客。這是他們的失職，還是他們有意......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "......算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "赫德雷呢，他在哪裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "他還在集結剩餘的雇傭兵，準備繼續去追那些逃走的囚犯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "讓他回來吧。那群囚犯的自由會有時限。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "......將軍？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "你說的，他傷得不輕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "將軍，恕我直言，你為何還這麼信任赫德雷？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "我讓你一直跟著他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "我沒記錯的話，你並沒有向我提起過，他犯了什麼錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "可他曾經替巴別塔工作過！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "今天就是他手下的雇傭兵壞的事，而且煽動那批雇傭兵的人也是他的老相識，將軍不覺得再這麼重用他，風險實在太大嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "......今天你都看見了。一個維多利亞人是怎麼看另一個維多利亞人的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "要讓一個薩卡茲信任另一個薩卡茲，又有多麼不容易？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "我們被奪走了一切，被迫習慣了從彼此手上爭奪活下去的權利。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "而現在，我們有了一個新的機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "你告訴我，你是想回去繼續監視一個可能的薩卡茲間諜，還是隨我一起處理剩下的維多利亞的麻煩們？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "將軍，我們選擇跟著你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "text": "呼......呼......我們是不是甩脫他們了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "費斯特先生，我們還不能放鬆警惕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "text": "我知道......哈......我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "......隊長。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "text": "怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "你臉上好多血。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "text": "血？！老比爾......比爾？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "text": "......原來是我自己流的血，那沒什麼要緊的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "text": "我說老比爾，你倒是喘氣聲重一些啊！我可不想費這麼大力氣背個死人回去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "text": "那你......揮扳手的時候輕一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戰士比爾",
      "text": "你總是......打到......我腦袋......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "text": "行，今天你說了算。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "text": "再堅持一會......我們馬上就要到家了。我沒看錯吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "text": "呃，我腦門上淌下來的血有點擋視線......洛洛，你多看著點，我們距離說好的接應點還有多遠？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "再走三百多米就到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "text": "在這守著的是六隊吧？我真的需要他們搭把手了，老比爾，你真是越來越重......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "text": "......我們有多久沒收到地面隊伍的信號了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "text": "博士不是說了，他們要抵達上一個接應點，才會聯繫我們嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "text": "不，我說的就是前一個接應點的自救軍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "text": "按照之前的約定，他們每過半個小時就會與我們同步地面上的情況。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "text": "糟了，我忘了算時間！這過去多久了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "text": "......我們得上去看一眼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "text": "不行！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "text": "假如前一個接應點已經被薩卡茲發現，那博士他們的隊伍就會有危險。你明明也很擔心摩根和達格達。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "text": "我......我也擔心你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "text": "大不了我去看一眼，維娜，你還是留在這裡，萬一真的有什麼情況，你就趕緊往深處跑......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "text": "因陀羅，我不能一直躲在你們身後。最初是老師，然後是你和格拉斯哥幫，還有博士——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "text": "——我躲得實在太久了。達格達說的並不是沒有道理。一個總在陰影裡躲躲藏藏的人，會漸漸失去直視太陽的勇氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "text": "她就是激你！她恨不得你能馬上就帶著她殺進皇宮裡，把那攝什麼王抓出來殺了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "text": "你也想立刻回去找格拉斯哥幫。你難道不理解她的想法？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "text": "我......我怎麼可能不懂她。但就是因為我懂，我才......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "text": "你怕她的衝動最終也會害死她自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "text": "難道不會嗎？她那副德行，我覺得她就是想找死！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "text": "......你該相信她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "text": "她會願意為了我們......也為了更多人活下去，即便這意味著極大的痛苦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "text": "她是一名優秀的騎士，也是維多利亞的戰士，她和無數努力活著且仍在為維多利亞奮戰的人一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "text": "而我......我需要與他們一塊戰鬥。這不是因為我的身份有什麼特殊的，而是因為......我們都是“本地人”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "text": "維娜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "text": "你覺得那位指揮官......克洛維希婭女士，她會丟下她的戰士，只為了自己的安全，而往回跑嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "text": "我跟她不熟......但我想她不會。那些戰士很信她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "text": "那你覺得我比她差很多嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "text": "怎麼可能！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "text": "那就隨我上去。我們一起確保我們的戰友能順利回家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "我們馬上就能離開這鬼地方了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "“間諜”，你還好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉密探",
      "text": "......哈......哈......我還好，蔓德拉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉密探",
      "text": "最近每次聽到有人喊我“間諜”......都是薩卡茲想出了什麼新的刑罰......我都快忘了，這就是我的代號。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "下回有機會的話，你得選個有品味一些的名字。我看“雄辯家”什麼的就不錯，反正他們都死得渣都不剩下了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉密探",
      "text": "哈哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "你先留點力氣吧，領袖還需要你找到的薩卡茲情報。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉密探",
      "text": "你是說......碎片大廈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "不，不要說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "我不是不想聽，但......我們需要得到領袖的許可。我們的戰士都是很純潔的人，不要給他們造成太大負擔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉密探",
      "text": "我懂......蔓德拉......你一直都是那個好姑娘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "......別跟“強盜”一樣油嘴滑舌。煩死了，他們都不在了，害得我一個人在這鬼地方為領袖操心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "還好你馬上就要回去了。你不在，那個阿赫茉妮一天到晚佔著領袖身邊的位子，我真怕......真怕......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉密探",
      "text": "你在怕......什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "我怕領袖和那些貴族走得太近......等哪天她就不要我們了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉密探",
      "text": "領袖她......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "長官，我已經確定了其他人的位置，他們還在老地方，替薩卡茲守著門。我們這就去跟他們會合嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "嗯。讓醫療兵準備好，“間諜”長官需要馬上得到治療。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "對了，還有......找個信使，立刻通知城外的莫寧伯爵。我們需要確保“間諜”能儘快見到領袖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉密探",
      "text": "莫寧伯爵？你......替領袖拉攏了他？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "嘖......在這種時候，我們還是只能指望貴族幫忙......挺可笑的不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉密探",
      "text": "咳咳......你......你長大了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "你廢話太多了，這不像你，“間諜”。剩下的廢話，等你不是這樣破破爛爛隨時都會死掉的時候再說吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "......停下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅本",
      "text": "怎麼了，號角？我們已經看到出口了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "注意你周圍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅本",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "三點鐘方向！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅本",
      "text": "號角，是薩卡茲！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "羅本，你的彈藥還夠嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅本",
      "text": "哈......哈哈......對不起，號角，其實我還偷偷藏了一枚榴彈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅本",
      "text": "我一直想，等哪天眼看著我又要落到深池或者薩卡茲的手裡......我一定抱著這枚榴彈衝上去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "......可惜，這榴彈是我們自製的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅本",
      "text": "那又怎樣......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "而且，很抱歉，我不想給你這個機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅本",
      "text": "啊？我的榴彈——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "果然，自己做的威力就是不太夠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅本",
      "text": "可是......可是也不至於......毫髮無傷吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅本",
      "text": "那個薩卡茲......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "那個薩卡茲就是他們口中的將軍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "......終於見面了。一顆自製榴彈可算不上什麼高規格的招呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "你見過的維多利亞士兵不會少，薩卡茲。畢竟他們之中的許多人就死在你手上，士兵們的亡靈恐怕排著隊都想擠進你的夢裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "不必妄自菲薄，維多利亞的白狼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "就算是放在薩卡茲裡，你也稱得上一名英勇的戰士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "我記得，在兩百年前的那場戰爭中，讓卡茲戴爾再次化作火海的維多利亞將領裡，就有你的祖先。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "你也是什麼活了幾百年的怪物嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "我無緣見證那場戰爭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "但你說起戰爭時的語氣，和你那些靠吸食別人性命而苟活的同族並沒有什麼差別。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "“沾上薩卡茲鮮血的人，必用千倍萬倍的血來償還。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "你當我們是因何而來，維多利亞人？究竟是誰在害怕倫蒂尼姆上空日日夜夜複述著血仇的亡靈？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "你知道嗎？我之所以選擇成為一名職業士兵，就是因為我厭倦了為眼前的戰鬥尋找理由。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "來吧，薩卡茲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "留在我耳朵裡的死者的話語並不比你能聽見的少。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "而且......我答應他們了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "在看到我的人活著離開之前，我一定不會倒下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
